{"id":"9366219236941f95","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-stone-representation.md","title":"Stone Representation","display":"df-stone-representation — Stone Representation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stone-representation","aliases":["58-df-stone-representation","Stone Representation"],"display":"df-stone-representation — Stone Representation","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stone-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stone-representation</span><span>Stone Representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stone-representation — Stone Representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,s,\\tau\\in V\">\\(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,s,\\tau\\in V\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra and representation data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_S(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,s,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{Ult}(B)=\\Bigl\\{u\\subseteq B\\ \\Bigm|\\\n1\\in u\\land0\\notin u\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in u\\;(a\\wedge b\\in u)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall a\\in u\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b=a\\to b\\in u)\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\in u\\lor\\neg b\\in u)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,B,\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}(B)))\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\bigl(s(b)=\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\mid b\\in u\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\tau=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\mid\\mathcal A\\subseteq s[B]\\}\n\\land s[B]=\\{C\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\mid C\\in\\tau\\land\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_S(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,s,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{Ult}(B)=\\Bigl\\{u\\subseteq B\\ \\Bigm|\\\n1\\in u\\land0\\notin u\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in u\\;(a\\wedge b\\in u)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall a\\in u\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b=a\\to b\\in u)\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\in u\\lor\\neg b\\in u)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,B,\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}(B)))\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\bigl(s(b)=\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\mid b\\in u\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\tau=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\mid\\mathcal A\\subseteq s[B]\\}\n\\land s[B]=\\{C\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\mid C\\in\\tau\\land\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stone representation: every Boolean algebra embeds into power set of its ultrafilters</li>\n<li>Stone space: compact, Hausdorff, zero-dimensional (basis of clopen sets)</li>\n<li>对无限离散 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> 的 Stone 空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta X\">\\(\\beta X\\)</span>，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>；二元 Boolean 代数的 Stone 空间是单点空间。</li>\n<li>Stone duality: category of Boolean algebras <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> zero-dimensional compact spaces</li>\n<li>Completeness: complete Boolean algebras correspond to extremally disconnected spaces</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Halmos, Lectures on Boolean Algebras</li>\n<li>Givant and Halmos, Introduction to Boolean Algebras</li>\n<li>Johnstone, Stone Spaces</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}$ (Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,s,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_S(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,s,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\operatorname{Ult}(B)=\\Bigl\\{u\\subseteq B\\ \\Bigm|\\\n1\\in u\\land0\\notin u\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in u\\;(a\\wedge b\\in u)\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall a\\in u\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b=a\\to b\\in u)\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\in u\\lor\\neg b\\in u)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,B,\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}(B)))\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\bigl(s(b)=\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\mid b\\in u\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\tau=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\mid\\mathcal A\\subseteq s[B]\\}\n\\land s[B]=\\{C\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\mid C\\in\\tau\\land\\operatorname{Ult}(B)\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false}],"bytes":2186,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-stone-representation.md|58-df-stone-representation]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a5e10857074b912e","36d7463d215be751"]}